<contentList>
  <content contentuid="hf58b60e9gd45ag42deg9a2cg53e64ecf7e7f" version="1">异人</content>
  <content contentuid="hec85e16cgb05bg4751g8a01g5f455adaedc7" version="1">甲申年间，异人界掀起了一场惨烈的内战，由无根生为首的三十六贼，被各方势力追杀，仅九人幸存，聚于二十四节谷，悟出八种惊天奇技。</content>
  <content contentuid="h27102227g7757g4b13g823fgcbe66a1d534d" version="1">【一元】神明灵</content>
  <content contentuid="hd23ccb90gea37g4301g90bdg2dbd9401357a" version="1">天下万物生于有，有生于无；无根而生，生而得一。一者为道，抱元守一；神得一以灵，故曰神明灵。</content>
  <content contentuid="h417b8404gad11g47b3g989eg67763535b242" version="1">神明灵</content>
  <content contentuid="h4fb1ac90gb530g46c1g80b6g92ef5218f482" version="1">瓦解一切敌人的指向性法术。</content>
  <content contentuid="h9cedf610gf288g4533gaceeg9b4e97127321" version="1">神莹内敛</content>
  <content contentuid="h73218cf6gee04g4806gabccgfe48c6d569c8" version="1">【跳跃翻倍且不消耗动作+免疫坠落伤害】返璞归真，神莹内敛。</content>
  <content contentuid="h58878874gf8d7g45c6gb3deg6ddae8e83afe" version="1">老农功</content>
  <content contentuid="he7e14412g96bfg43e3g82dfgc2133e64701a" version="1">【全属性+2/杀敌回炁】炁沉下丹，周而复始，颇为神秘。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2f0bd4cfg5c58g4f41ga4a2g852d9756f5e8" version="1">太极劲</content>
  <content contentuid="h4ac4a5e7gf42ag4a9fg99e8g2a78418c0213" version="1">推开目标并造成伤害，有概率将其击倒。</content>
  <content contentuid="h4f386f3cg4565g4ba4g8e73g0f736368f5ca" version="1">【两仪】双全手</content>
  <content contentuid="h5914b27bg3b60g4c04gb9d1gea82b66b0c04" version="1">【心灵抗性】魂为性，身为命，性命双全。</content>
  <content contentuid="h44e835cag4445g4462g9f92g8c46c19935cd" version="1">蓝手</content>
  <content contentuid="ha9a43d16g6006g4e5bgba64g297ce1c40132" version="1">对自身范围内的敌人造成心灵伤害，并造成心灵撕裂，降低其智力与感知豁免。</content>
  <content contentuid="hc270c286gd532g4bfcg9b71gd06518cce4d9" version="1">红手</content>
  <content contentuid="hd1413efbgfc9bg46ddg8967ga2055a3421f9" version="1">治疗自身范围内的同伴，并驱散其诅咒、疾病、中毒、虚弱、震慑、石化、魅惑状态。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb395e3e6g909ag4783g8d93g917f8e3967c3" version="1">【三才】通天箓</content>
  <content contentuid="hcb4da7dcgf3d0g4f7fg9202g2394de9b76c0" version="1">【动作+1】天下符箓信手拈来，无需设坛无需行炁。</content>
  <content contentuid="h17831a51gc2a9g4840gb5ebg556cb81b1252" version="1">逆生三重</content>
  <content contentuid="h4c7cec64g691ag4342g9bacg8d64356ce88e" version="1">获得临时生命，并对任何使用近战攻击命中你的生物造成力场伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb91649c6g8c50g4351g9f23g31ba56b32388" version="1">上清派·困仙符</content>
  <content contentuid="h57c414deg8807g4dd9g89f1geed13d97b4df" version="1">有概率困住任何目标。</content>
  <content contentuid="he73bef2eg1df5g4503gab94ga315a812467f" version="1">正一派·五雷符</content>
  <content contentuid="h56609b3fg3ca9g411cg9bd7gf670b6499c55" version="1">对选定范围内的敌人造成闪电伤害，并创造水电地面。</content>
  <content contentuid="ha7b7c96dg099cg4489gba2bgf7e32f5a5799" version="1">灵宝派·太玄咒</content>
  <content contentuid="h72166a06gceabg4182ga8e8gfe328cb2e1aa" version="1">对选定范围内的敌人造成寒冷伤害，并创造冰冻地面，有概率造成冻僵。</content>
  <content contentuid="hc1b3bfe7g09ccg43d8gb846g718f9be13b19" version="1">【四象】拘灵遣将</content>
  <content contentuid="ha8bbe42dg170eg46fdg997cged601ae2c73c" version="1">【光耀+黯蚀抗性】拘四圣之灵，遣亡者为将。</content>
  <content contentuid="h848ba6a9g0f15g4b37gb4f6ga531865b7b1f" version="1">拘灵·四圣</content>
  <content contentuid="h70f22a2bg2c30g497bg993dg2e2c5fe1a99c" version="1">【光耀附伤-徒手】天之四灵，以正四方。</content>
  <content contentuid="hac90497bge872g4908ga3ffg57221c8121bb" version="1">遣将·亡魂</content>
  <content contentuid="h3427e733g6d98g46adg8efbg38f64d261e71" version="1">将尸体的灵魂化为与你并肩作战的阴影。</content>
  <content contentuid="h543b6e98g9309g4adfg9a8ag2423dd330e23" version="1">【五行】神机百炼</content>
  <content contentuid="hcc37bf1cge545g418cg95ccg638bda3d2b16" version="1">【物理抗性】悟彻神机，剞劂无迹。</content>
  <content contentuid="h3d939e1ag9bf7g4fdeg894ag8903924c3295" version="1">御物</content>
  <content contentuid="h82937870gace4g462eg8648gdfa7b2350918" version="1">减少远程武器对你的伤害，如果你完全挡下此次攻击，则可将其投射回去。</content>
  <content contentuid="h59e68f38gc299g4c9eg859bg062e14ce24f1" version="1">乌斗铠</content>
  <content contentuid="h7d819f93gb2dag4e79gafc0g3a563492d592" version="1">【AC+5】防御力极高的护体法器。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb2e64368g4eafg4077ga064g35d377004215" version="1">三宝珠</content>
  <content contentuid="h2c09b30dg457bg41efg8310g751185e04357" version="1">【坚韧不屈】每场战斗免死一次。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7dcc1bdfgbe6ag4224g96c5ge221781ae198" version="1">盗吞兽</content>
  <content contentuid="h0d336c48gf0ccg4b2cg824ag25249c4717f5" version="1">获得一个附赠动作，每回合恢复一点炁。</content>
  <content contentuid="h362dce95g9173g4c3dga906g31179d2dc037" version="1">六合珠</content>
  <content contentuid="hea014d70ge1f0g48cbgbe13g94a7f711b9d6" version="1">对自身范围内的敌人造成力场伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h182638cfg65e2g4cd6g83d7g5015b158e689" version="1">【六合】六库仙贼</content>
  <content contentuid="h6d65320cg7df9g4982gac87ge53965353c2e" version="1">【强酸+毒素抗性】圣人不死，大盗不止；吞噬生机，肉身成圣。</content>
  <content contentuid="h07135e5bg13ccg4f70ga982g3a9bede55950" version="1">饕餮之噬</content>
  <content contentuid="h78a9138bgab3fg49a1gb585gc39ff43a8b33" version="1">对目标造成强酸伤害，并吸取等值生命，同时降低目标力量，如果其力量归零则死亡。</content>
  <content contentuid="hee8528f7g8e4fg4d7egb9a1g2909c3210e4d" version="1">不死狂怒</content>
  <content contentuid="h31446535gb5e7g4d43g9c29gdbab01187a32" version="1">生命低于40%时，发出骨颤的咆哮，推开附近所有敌人，造成强酸伤害，并吸取等值生命。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2656a78fgb851g44ccg95d3g2420bc27f574" version="1">【七星】大罗洞观</content>
  <content contentuid="hbf0ed99cg669cg4a50g8861g0fdeb390a22f" version="1">【天眼通】至虚极，守静笃，万物并作，吾以观其复。</content>
  <content contentuid="h4000de0bg08b6g4dc7ga081g7115918af0cf" version="1">笑歌自乐</content>
  <content contentuid="h0f098fbeg3e93g4e73g83f6g1ce4fcddf9ec" version="1">对敌人瞬间造成7次力场伤害，攻击后你将返回原地。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd9e4dc2ag771dg4e4bgab52gdd71e4ca6a3b" version="1">洞观千古</content>
  <content contentuid="h8d1407d8g8032g4ab7gb8fegf2c2f156dc06" version="1">当敌人试图发动攻击或施法时，将其放逐到异空间1回合。</content>
  <content contentuid="h9c43b1a1g861eg47c7gb278g3b97d7e1467f" version="1">【八卦】风后奇门</content>
  <content contentuid="haf74f502g8cdeg4a4ag81b7g9008aa7f992d" version="1">【火焰+寒冷抗性】盖周天之变，化吾为王。</content>
  <content contentuid="had53c442gd951g434ag805bg9d1f89606dd1" version="1">定中宫</content>
  <content contentuid="h780d5d9fg8011g462bg83c6gc11c023d58e7" version="1">调转奇门阵内格局，对自身范围内的敌人造成元素易伤。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6a81b8d5g7a65g48b1g96e4g30096a737188" version="1">离字·炼狱</content>
  <content contentuid="ha72e1babgdd0eg4fa1gbbfagaa79a600c6ad" version="1">对选定范围内的敌人造成火焰伤害，并创造地狱火地面。</content>
  <content contentuid="h924ae934g75f2g40f0gb04dg7ad2c64e409a" version="1">坤字·土河车</content>
  <content contentuid="h63581fa9g0101g4a5eg98ebg5c9c6f172e0d" version="1">创造劣势地形，对触碰到的敌人造成钝击伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h4c49d4c2g7065g4356gb68eg1febe608e8af" version="1">土河屏障</content>
  <content contentuid="h3b72205fg924bg494dg8a4dg84102974839d" version="1">对接近石柱的敌人造成钝击伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd5e2d9f2gd0aeg4879gbe59g46df50fea953" version="1">乱金柝</content>
  <content contentuid="hfe879586gaa38g43ddgba08geb1aee6c4508" version="1">对自身范围内的敌人施加缓速，目标移速减半，同时护甲等级和敏捷豁免检定-2，并且无法做出反应，也无法进行多次行动，持续10回合。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb068eba5g6a73g46bbga648g8d35ba99e1a5" version="1">【九宫】炁体源流</content>
  <content contentuid="hb62ad5c7gc14bg44b8gbef0g7b5ade96e6a5" version="1">【法术抗性】术之尽头，炁体源流。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd2c49a15g2193g4026gb6dcg41fc924289ad" version="1">五雷正法·掌心雷</content>
  <content contentuid="h9d3c1d04g0bc8g464ag92beg3a6c820abfc6" version="1">受到伤害自动反击，并有概率造成麻痹。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0ae547f5gdb10g4437g867eg1ffc1cdc00a1" version="1">金光咒</content>
  <content contentuid="h6787fc28g66adg4114g9efdg1a2075bf46bc" version="1">获得力场抗性，并释放炁，使自身范围内的敌人在攻击掷骰及豁免检定中处于劣势。</content>
  <content contentuid="h1b273d41g97afg46cagb91agf4a9c5d3aa04" version="1">受到金光咒的影响，在攻击掷骰及豁免检定中处于劣势。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7c9181f6gb798g479egb5e6g498fdd42f5d7" version="1">【天师道】</content>
  <content contentuid="he5ee335bgd4c6g40c4ga078g1a4e9105015b" version="1">【雷鸣+闪电抗性】道不远，在身中。</content>
  <content contentuid="h194f6287gb392g4ec2ga25fg08788d0f7ab9" version="1">五雷正法</content>
  <content contentuid="h36686c16g8971g4d80ga2bagee55f982b812" version="1">绛宫雷又称阳五雷，清澈灵动，刚猛无俦；水脏雷又称阴五雷，无拘无束，纵性自在。</content>
  <content contentuid="h5edb69e7gfad1g4eccgaf60g7212691e8207" version="1">绛宫雷·迅雷</content>
  <content contentuid="ha9c868adg4eb3g4489g9ac5g4d7d69ab31a4" version="1">化作雷电向前穿梭，对沿途敌人造成雷电伤害，有概率击退并造成感电。</content>
  <content contentuid="h123c8d43gb155g4b69g8e28geadc37aaeb87" version="1">绛宫雷·小白虫</content>
 <content contentuid="hcb6e4140gd352g470fg8833gb91899e38b0e" version="1">对敌人造成雷电伤害，在命中一个敌人后会自动攻击范围内另外至多三个敌人，有概率造成感电。</content>
 <content contentuid="h60a12a1cg8efeg4968ga8beg3a76fd4c1197" version="1">水脏雷·北境苍潭</content>
 <content contentuid="hf2d6e56dg843dg4c4ag8332g2db0c937c0f0" version="1">释放大量阴雷覆盖一片区域，范围内的敌人将陷入目盲与减速，并且敌我不分。</content>
 <content contentuid="h80d3e643g7be8g461cg8874g3a299619d194" version="1">水脏雷·游蚓雷</content>
<content contentuid="h9759a873g859ag46c3g9411gcf1e9072e988" version="1">获得重度遮蔽，自身9m范围内的生物攻击你时，扭曲的阴雷会自动反击，造成雷电伤害。</content>

</contentList>